# Dashboard sync — apply instructions (2026-08-14)

Wires the wheel engine into the new Optionable engine-observability panels
(commit 257b0d2 on smitpatel316/optionable): the Capital & Collateral card and
the Scan funnel on the Options tab.

## What lands

1. New module: `core/optionable_dashboard_sync.py` — ALREADY ON DISK in this
   repo (not yet committed). It tees stdout+stderr at run start, parses the
   known log formats ([ACCOUNT], [CONTEXT], [SGOV], [DATA], [BP], [FUND],
   [EARNINGS], [DIVIDEND], [LIQ], Optionable CSP-log lines, Sell failed/Skipping
   lines) into a snapshot + per-symbol scan funnel, and POSTs both to
   `{OPTIONABLE_URL}/api/engine/dashboard` at end of run. Fail-safe: every
   public method swallows exceptions after a warning — it can never break a
   trading run. Read/display only; places no orders.

2. Two small edits to `scripts/run_strategy.py` (unified diff below; if the
   stress-test branch moved these lines, apply by hand — the context lines are
   stable):

```diff
--- a/scripts/run_strategy.py
+++ b/scripts/run_strategy.py
@@ -128,6 +128,13 @@
     strat_logger = StrategyLogger(enabled=args.strat_log)
     logger = setup_logger(level=args.log_level, to_file=args.log_to_file)
     strat_logger.set_fresh_start(args.fresh_start)
+
+    # Engine dashboard push: collects this run's account snapshot + per-symbol
+    # scan funnel from the log stream and POSTs them to Optionable at end of
+    # run (core/optionable_dashboard_sync.py). Never raises; display-only.
+    from core.optionable_dashboard_sync import EngineDashboardPush
+    dash_push = EngineDashboardPush()
+    dash_push.install()
 
     SYMBOLS_FILE = Path(__file__).parent.parent / "config" / "symbol_list.txt"
     with open(SYMBOLS_FILE, 'r') as file:
@@ -620,6 +627,19 @@
         strat_logger.save()
     except Exception as e:
         logger.debug(f"Strategy logger save failed: {e}")
+
+    # Push the account snapshot + scan funnel to the Optionable dashboard.
+    try:
+        from datetime import datetime as _dt
+        from zoneinfo import ZoneInfo
+        _h = int(_dt.now(ZoneInfo("America/New_York")).strftime("%H"))
+        _slot = {10: "morning 10:05 ET", 13: "midday 13:05 ET", 15: "afternoon 15:05 ET"}.get(_h, f"run {_h}:05 ET")
+        dash_push.push(client, SYMBOLS, locals().get("allowed_symbols", []), slot=_slot)
+    except Exception as _e:
+        logger.debug(f"dashboard push failed: {_e}")
+    finally:
+        dash_push.uninstall()
 
 if __name__ == "__main__":
     main()
```

