## Known approximation

`contractsConsidered` + `aggregateRejects` come from the
"[DATA] option filter rejected all N contracts" line, which fires for roll scans
too, so on days with rolls the chip counts blend roll and new-CSP scans. The
per-symbol rows (the part Smit reads) are exact. Per-symbol contract counts need
a symbol arg added to filter_options — a bigger change, deliberately deferred.
